__biz=MzU0NDY4NTc3OQ==&amp;mid=2247503582&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=de3dcf89db176282cba0b094abb74b17&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“逐梦山海·启智未来”2025浙江大学台州研究院药学学科建设研讨会顺利召开</a></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span>●<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU0NDY4NTc3OQ==&amp;mid=2247503582&amp;idx=2&amp;sn=56202152a5e3cf9a81300e54548b579b&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">聚焦微纳光学技术丨浙大台州研究院与苏州镁伽科技签署联合实验室合作协议</a></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>●</span><span><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU0NDY4NTc3OQ==&amp;mid=2247503544&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=250ff1c3972797f6c17ef12d4ccbde46&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新华社《瞭望》丨研发型中试平台生长之道</a></span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/ONOphTqMOCaxP26fXxlMlBfu6iajq0EVJwWY8ggqTovOjbyzN4pGR8gupxNR0f9mMxicLFdp5icFbVib0eKibA4bmbA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"5f5ba1d2990d5c96b16295fa9f431bc1e3e1fbf56997f0cfc91cca209f6500a2","textLength":2054,"sourceSha256":"814d74125fdfbb04921400bf258db3234398b149b4517693420d36a4c5b6c501","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-84fd0d44c174c299e406","title":"2025年浙江大学台州研究院2026年全日制专业学位硕士研究生推荐免试招生通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:35.702401+00:00"}
